@startuml
title Interaction 3 — Record Consultation (UC08; design only)
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor HealthcareProfessional as Professional
boundary ":ClinicCLI" as UI
control ":ConsultationController" as Controller
control ":AccessPolicy" as Access
entity ":AppointmentBook" as Book
entity "a:Appointment" as Appointment
entity ":ClinicalRecordCatalog" as Records
entity "record:ClinicalRecord" as Record
control ":UnitOfWork" as Tx
entity ":AuditLog" as Audit
Professional -> UI: Submit clinical information
UI -> Controller: recordConsultation(appointmentID, observations, diagnoses,\ntreatmentRecommendations, followUpRequirements)
Controller -> Book: get(appointmentID)
Book --> Controller: a
Controller -> Access: requireAssignedProfessionalAndCareScope(session, a)
Controller -> Appointment: requireConfirmedAndArrivedWithoutConsultation()
Controller -> Controller: validateAtLeastOneNonBlankClinicalField()
Controller -> Records: getForPatient(a.patientID)
Records --> Controller: record (or notFound)
alt all checks pass
  group atomic unit of work
    Controller -> Tx: begin()
    create entity "c:Consultation" as Consultation
    Controller -> Consultation: create(uniqueID, clinical fields, appointmentID)
    Controller -> Record: stageAdd(c)
    Controller -> Appointment: stageComplete(c)
    Controller -> Audit: stageRecord(actorID, patientID, recordConsultation, success)
    Controller -> Tx: commit()
  end
  Controller --> UI: consultationID, appointmentStatus = completed
  UI --> Professional: Consultation recorded
  opt medication prescribed (separate operation and transaction)
    ref over UI,Audit: issuePrescription(consultationID, items): validate prescribing authority and all items, then commit
  end
  opt follow-up needed (separate operation and transaction)
    ref over UI,Audit: searchAvailability(...); requestFollowUp(...): derive patient from consultation, reuse booking + resource validation
  end
else validation or access check fails
  Controller -> Audit: recordDeniedAttempt(actorID, patientID?, failureCode)
  Controller --> UI: accessDenied / invalidState / invalidInput / notFound
end
note over Controller,Audit
Audit/commit failure discards consultation, associations and completion together.
Audit records contain no clinical content. Optional operation failures never undo c.
Arrival and clinical workflow are design-only in this scheduling PoC.
end note
@enduml
